[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
Halda River east-bank canal catchment (outlet 22.519540 N, 91.849516 E), 2.23 km2 (Google Earth polygon).
Subcatchment areas, %imperv (Landsat 30 m supervised classification) and DEM-based inverts are from the GIS.
Width, slope, pervious roughness/infiltration, canal depth and outfall stage are assumptions (see parameters workbook).

[OPTIONS]
;;Option             Value
FLOW_UNITS           CMS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
ALLOW_PONDING        YES
SKIP_STEADY_STATE    NO

START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2026
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/03/2026
END_TIME             00:00:00
SWEEP_START          01/01
SWEEP_END            12/31
DRY_DAYS             5
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:05 
RULE_STEP            00:00:00

INERTIAL_DAMPING     PARTIAL
NORMAL_FLOW_LIMITED  BOTH
FORCE_MAIN_EQUATION  H-W
VARIABLE_STEP        0.75
LENGTHENING_STEP     0
MIN_SURFAREA         1.14
MAX_TRIALS           8
HEAD_TOLERANCE       0.0015
SYS_FLOW_TOL         5
LAT_FLOW_TOL         5
MINIMUM_STEP         0.5
THREADS              1

